                      Dirty Fight
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Syntax: dirtyfight <feint|punch|sand> [target]

Spend one Opportunity on one of three distinct tricks. Feint applies
Exposed. Punch deals blunt damage and disrupts Concentration. Sand
attempts to Blind the target.

Establishing a fresh condition finds one Opportunity. If a target is
immune to Punch or Sand's control, the attempt uses half SP, half its
normal recovery, and has a 50% chance to retain the Opportunity.

